        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-11T13:57:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why return the pointer tho, can\u0027t you just return the index and then access the vector when needed? Or if you want to hold it for a while, store the index and then just get the pointer in short lived instances.",
